# Native shells are GENERATED (`npx cap add ios|android`), including in CI —
# see docs/NATIVE.md. Commit them only once you need to hand-edit native config
# (Info.plist keys, icons, capabilities), and then drop them from this list.
#
# ios/ is now COMMITTED: App/App/Info.plist carries the AdMob
# GADApplicationIdentifier by hand, which a fresh `cap add ios` would not
# recreate. android/ has no hand-edited config yet, so it stays generated.
android/
